{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Junkyard Universe is a 2D Galaxy Cleaner - Cleaning Up the Universe Has Never Been More Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dissolve space trash into nothing and make space travelling saver for everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebel agains the system by installing a repair upgrade to repair things instead of just dissolving them. Let the results of using the repair particles suprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Upgrades and game mechanics skillfully to collect enough dissolve points for your very own junk eraser ship, before the dissolve year is over and your points are reset to 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow pilot Meredith on her search for her lost mother Elaina. Build a relationship with Junk Eraser Ship 3LS4, the ship that returned without Elaina. Decide which rebels you want to trust - and what you want to do with your junk eraser ship once it belongs to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808920?t=1749882274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808920?t=1749882274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808920/ef7e5449c644e332a913b0357959b5bf364a6ba0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749882274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808920/ef7e5449c644e332a913b0357959b5bf364a6ba0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749882274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Junkyard Universe is a 2D Galaxy Cleaner - Cleaning Up the Universe Has Never Been More Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dissolve space trash into nothing and make space travelling saver for everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebel agains the system by installing a repair upgrade to repair things instead of just dissolving them. Let the results of using the repair particles suprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Upgrades and game mechanics skillfully to collect enough dissolve points for your very own junk eraser ship, before the dissolve year is over and your points are reset to 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow pilot Meredith on her search for her lost mother Elaina. Build a relationship with Junk Eraser Ship 3LS4, the ship that returned without Elaina. Decide which rebels you want to trust - and what you want to do with your junk eraser ship once it belongs to you.</p>","developers":["Sarah Dressel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808920/6c7c4e6f05e7016e6221b54273c53c5d24dfd7ed/header.jpg?t=1749882274","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154002,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154002/movie480.mp4?t=1749882267","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154002/movie_max.mp4?t=1749882267"},"name":"Junkyard Universe - Repair Particles","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154002/38e654e3b4b0acc37adffc813995b98c1a2b02bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749882267","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154002/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749882267","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154002/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749882267"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257154004,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154004/movie480.mp4?t=1749882270","max":"http://video.akamai.st